---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
const calendly = 'https://calendly.com/contact-advised-seo/30min?back=1';
---
<Base
  title="SEO & GEO for Black-skin beauty — win back sales | AfriRank"
  description="Your customers search their exact shade on Google; a retailer sells it. AfriRank brings that revenue back to you. 30-min call, no commitment."
  lang="en"
  frPath="/offre-seo-beaute/"
  enPath="/en/seo-beauty/"
  noindex={true}
  bare={true}>

<header class="lp-head">
  <div class="wrap lp-head-inner">
    <img src="/images/logo-dark.png" alt="AfriRank" class="lp-logo" />
    <a href={calendly} class="btn btn--blue lp-head-cta">Book my call
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
    </a>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="hero hero--page wrap lp-hero">
  <div class="hero-top">
    <span class="hero-eyebrow reveal"><img src="/images/icon-orange.png" alt="" /> SEO &amp; GEO · beauty for Black skin</span>
    <h1 class="reveal">Your customers search for their exact shade. <em>A retailer is the one selling it.</em></h1>
    <p class="hero-sub reveal">“Foundation for deep skin tones”, “warm-undertone shade for brown skin”: you formulated for these complexions from day one, yet it's retailers and marketplaces that show up first. AfriRank gives you your shades back — without depending on ads.</p>
    <div class="lp-cta reveal">
      <a href={calendly} class="btn btn--orange">Book my 30-min call
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
      </a>
      <span class="lp-cta-note">No commitment · reply within 48h</span>
    </div>
    <p class="lp-trust reveal">11 years of SEO expertise · Groupe SEB · LumApps · Rubix · Bonduelle · BPIFrance</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="wrap" style="padding-top:8px">
  <figure class="lp-figure reveal"><img src="/images/article-beaute.jpg" alt="Makeup products for dark and deep skin tones" loading="lazy" width="1280" height="560" /></figure>
</section>

<section class="sec lp-sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head center reveal"><span class="kicker">What you get</span><h2 class="sec-title">Lasting visibility, not an endless ad budget.</h2></div>
    <div class="lp-benefits">
      <div class="lp-benefit reveal"><span class="v-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M3 3v18h18M7 14l4-4 3 3 5-6"/></svg></span><h3>Traffic you own</h3><p>An organic channel that keeps working when you switch the ads off.</p></div>
      <div class="lp-benefit reveal"><span class="v-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M12 3 4 7v5c0 4.5 3.4 7.5 8 9 4.6-1.5 8-4.5 8-9V7Z"/></svg></span><h3>Every shade findable</h3><p>Complexion, undertone, shade matches: your product pages answer “is this shade right for MY skin?”.</p></div>
      <div class="lp-benefit reveal"><span class="v-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8 12h8M12 8v8"/></svg></span><h3>Cited by AI (GEO)</h3><p>“Which foundation for warm-undertone brown skin?” — your brand, the specialist, should be the answer.</p></div>
      <div class="lp-benefit reveal"><span class="v-ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"><path d="M12 3 4 7v5c0 4.5 3.4 7.5 8 9 4.6-1.5 8-4.5 8-9V7Z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></span><h3>A senior expert, one point of contact</h3><p>Enterprise-grade expertise, accountable end to end — and who hands you the keys.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec lp-sec lp-proof">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head center reveal"><span class="kicker">The proof</span><h2 class="sec-title">Senior expertise, measurable.</h2></div>
    <div class="stats">
      <div class="stat reveal"><div class="num">11 years</div><div class="lbl">of SEO experience — agency-side, then in-house</div></div>
      <div class="stat reveal"><div class="num">23 sites</div><div class="lbl">migrated in 2 years for Groupe SEB (technical SEO lead)</div></div>
      <div class="stat reveal"><div class="num">+59%</div><div class="lbl">more MQLs generated at LumApps (B2B SaaS)</div></div>
      <div class="stat reveal"><div class="num">300+</div><div class="lbl">AI-driven content pieces produced in 2 years</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec lp-sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cta-band reveal">
      <img src="/images/icon-cream.png" class="icon-watermark" alt="" />
      <span class="kicker" style="color:var(--orange);justify-content:center">Where to start</span>
      <h2>The AfriRank Diagnostic.</h2>
      <p>30 minutes to put a number on the revenue retailers capture on your shades — and map the plan to win it back. No commitment.</p>
      <div class="cta-actions">
        <a href={calendly} class="btn btn--orange">Book my 30-min call
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="mailto:contact@advised-seo.fr" class="btn btn--cream">contact@advised-seo.fr</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="lp-foot">
  <div class="wrap lp-foot-inner">
    <img src="/images/logo-dark.png" alt="AfriRank" class="lp-foot-logo" />
    <span>© 2026 AfriRank — Francis Ndimba</span>
    <a href="/en/legal-notice/">Legal notice</a>
    <a href="mailto:contact@advised-seo.fr">contact@advised-seo.fr</a>
  </div>
</footer>

<script is:inline>
  window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
  window.dataLayer.push({ event: 'lp_view', lp: 'seo-beauty', page_path: location.pathname });
</script>
</Base>
